# R147 Task 4, shape 11: a slice of a kosh a slice inside a comparison, used as an index.
# An escape prints 7 (the old elements) where k[0] is 99. v307 compiled shapes 1-3, 5-7, 9 and 13 and printed 7.
mukhya() {
    kosh k[1]
    kosh_kship(k, 7)
    vitti obstacle = nirmmita(16)
    mala box[2]
    box[1] = 5
    vitti zero = 0
    likha(box[k[0:1] > zero])
}
